    <briefdescription>
<para>QSGMaterial for <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput> marker rendering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Marker positions are read from the inherited data texture as interleaved XY floats, so the vertex buffer depends only on the point count. With <computeroutput>useVertexColor</computeroutput> == 1 the markers take their color from <computeroutput>gradientTexture</computeroutput> at their position along <computeroutput>gradientDirection</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
